{"4400300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HAUNTMATES", "steam_appid": 4400300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAUNTMATES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter randomly generated locations to find the active zone and gather evidence. Your team uses a shared synchronized board to log clues and select the name of the entity. Work with your squad, bring your equipment, and complete side objectives to get a higher payout before you head to the extraction point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/eceb48b36b170df8e7cc1f8cbbb61d6e.poster.avif?t=1783000817\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/eceb48b36b170df8e7cc1f8cbbb61d6e.webm?t=1783000817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/eceb48b36b170df8e7cc1f8cbbb61d6e.mp4?t=1783000817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hauntmates is a cooperative horror investigation game. You need to communicate and work together to survive. The longer you stay inside, the harder it gets because more monsters will start to spawn across the map. If you die, you fail the contract and lose all your gear and payout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/81eaeff0d251c9b55c465e7ba1c42a4b.poster.avif?t=1783000817\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/81eaeff0d251c9b55c465e7ba1c42a4b.webm?t=1783000817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/81eaeff0d251c9b55c465e7ba1c42a4b.mp4?t=1783000817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Player Multiplayer:</strong> Play with your friends or try to survive alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat:</strong> Stick together and talk because nobody will hear you if you wander off too far.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly Generated Maps:</strong> The terrain changes every time you play, so you cannot rely on memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Investigation Board:</strong> Log your gathered evidence and select the final name together on one synchronized board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Monsters:</strong> Face several different monsters with specific behaviors and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation Gear:</strong> Use thermometers, flashlights, and many more to find the active zone and gather evidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes Economy:</strong> Push your luck for extra side objectives. If you die before reaching the extraction point, you lose your gear and leave with nothing.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAUNTMATES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter randomly generated locations to find the active zone and gather evidence. Your team uses a shared synchronized board to log clues and select the name of the entity. Work with your squad, bring your equipment, and complete side objectives to get a higher payout before you head to the extraction point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/eceb48b36b170df8e7cc1f8cbbb61d6e.poster.avif?t=1783000817\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/eceb48b36b170df8e7cc1f8cbbb61d6e.webm?t=1783000817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/eceb48b36b170df8e7cc1f8cbbb61d6e.mp4?t=1783000817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hauntmates is a cooperative horror investigation game. You need to communicate and work together to survive. The longer you stay inside, the harder it gets because more monsters will start to spawn across the map. If you die, you fail the contract and lose all your gear and payout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/81eaeff0d251c9b55c465e7ba1c42a4b.poster.avif?t=1783000817\" width=570 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/81eaeff0d251c9b55c465e7ba1c42a4b.webm?t=1783000817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/extras/81eaeff0d251c9b55c465e7ba1c42a4b.mp4?t=1783000817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Player Multiplayer:</strong> Play with your friends or try to survive alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat:</strong> Stick together and talk because nobody will hear you if you wander off too far.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly Generated Maps:</strong> The terrain changes every time you play, so you cannot rely on memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Investigation Board:</strong> Log your gathered evidence and select the final name together on one synchronized board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Monsters:</strong> Face several different monsters with specific behaviors and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation Gear:</strong> Use thermometers, flashlights, and many more to find the active zone and gather evidence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes Economy:</strong> Push your luck for extra side objectives. If you die before reaching the extraction point, you lose your gear and leave with nothing.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Co-op horror investigation game across multiple maps. Enter procedurally generated environments, use your equipment to gather clues, and identify the entity. Watch your back, because monsters are hunting you down.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/5332204e8f25f61f73b3dd5d2bcaabee75fb260f/header.jpg?t=1783000817", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/3fc0a266202c38e2ef59886d8909ed71af55b6f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783000817", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4400300/3fc0a266202c38e2ef59886d8909ed71af55b6f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783000817", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 @ 3.00GHz / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeFor